cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MathProof Skill, please cite this repository."
title: "MathProof Skill"
abstract: >-
  A correctness-first skill for AI agents (Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity) that
  constructs and audits mathematical proofs: it locates the first unsupported step,
  searches for counterexamples, and machine-checks verdicts in Lean 4 with Mathlib,
  using a checker that rejects sorry, custom axioms, native_decide, and kernel bypasses.
type: software
authors:
